    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Any time of day, wherever you are, there’s always a great reason to choose Hormel Foods. You provide the hunger, we’ll deliver the great ﬂavor and convenience that keeps you moving throughout the day."
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
